      "description": "Clark County invites qualified firms or individuals to submit bids. Questions regarding this bid must be directed to the Bid Contact listed in this bid. The work will generally consist of improvements on Las Vegas Boulevard from Flamingo Road to Spring Mountain Road for a length of approximately one mile. The project includes cold planing, plantmix bituminous surface, UTACS, pedestrian protection device installation, curb and gutter reconstruction, sidewalk, sidewalk reconstruction/widening, sidewalk ramps, median reconstruction, bus turnouts, street lights and Smart poles, LED landscape lighting conversion, landscaping/irrigation modifications, traffic signal modifications at 6 intersections, utility adjustments, storm sewer facilities, pavement markings, signing, power and communication system installation and connection to new Smart poles. The work also includes a installation of a new waterline for the entire project length along Las Vegas Boulevard to replace an existing waterline for the Las Vegas Valley Water District. The Work also includes improvements to Flamingo Road from I-15 to Koval Lane, for a length of approximately three quarters of a mile. The Work will generally consist of improvements including curb and gutter, removing and replacing damaged sidewalk for Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) current standards, traffic signal modifications including detector loop installation, utility adjustments, cold planing, plantmix bituminous surface, UTACS, storm drain installation, permanent striping and signing, and street lighting LED luminaires.",
